OL,5,G0300 Prue Leith's Cotswold Kitchen
OL,6,     FPrue is joined in her kitchen by
OL,7,     Freality TV star Gemma Collins, who
OL,8,     Fcooks her favourite crispy lamb
OL,9,     Fcutlets with a Parmesan crumb.
OL,10,     FPrue also makes herbed salmon
OL,11,     Fparcels with a pea puree and lemon
OL,12,     Fmayo, while her husband John heads
OL,13,     Foff to Paddock Farm to see his
OL,14,     Ffavourite Tamworth pigs
